<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Amoy Prop.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Amoy Prop.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Intenational &amp; Co C.V. said on Wednesday it has launched 400 million American style call warrants on shares of Amoy Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$11.25	 PREMIUM	    16.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.187	 GEARING	    6.02x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  11.DEC.97	SETTLEMENT DATE  03.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     06.JAN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$11.25	 EXER LOT	   5,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
